Package: oofilter
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign boolean logic evaluator and stream predicate filter
 Evaluates boolean logic expressions against structured stream line objects.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 field indexing, relational comparisons, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
